IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `bla-shipping-documents`

-- Bills of Lading Act 1992, ss 1 to 5 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_bills-of-lading-act-1992.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`an order bill of lading` MEANS ShippingDocument WITH
    `is in the form of a bill of lading` IS TRUE
    `transferable by indorsement or as a bearer bill` IS TRUE
    `is a received for shipment bill` IS FALSE
    `is a receipt containing or evidencing a contract of carriage by sea` IS TRUE
    `identifies the person to whom the carrier is to deliver` IS TRUE
    `contains the carrier's undertaking to deliver to an identified person` IS FALSE

